<title>USA: Oak Industries Inc Q4 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Oak Industries Inc Q4 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit	$0.52	 profit   $0.23</p>
<p> Net profit	9,704	 profit   4,183</p>
<p> Revs		70,123		   69,026</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  18,829		   18,522</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit	$2.24	 loss     $2.83</p>
<p> Net profit	41,836	loss     52,124</p>
<p> Revs		303,536		  255,364</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  18,684		   18,423</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 oper shr $0.07 vs $0.22.</p>
<p>'96 Q4 and yr in table includes gain $9.4 million, or $0.50/shr, from sale of discontinued operations, and extraordinary charge $949,000, or $0.05/shr, from early retirement of debt.</p>
<p>'95 Q4 includes income $135,000, or $0.01/shr, from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>'95 yr includes income from discontinued operations of $2.5 million, or $0.13/shr, and extraordinary charge $1.6 million, or $0.09/shr, from early retirement of debt.</p>
<p>'96 yr includes $1.4 million, or $0.08/shr, income from discontinued operations.</p>
</text>
